DHCP Lease Manager for pfSense.

An enhanced view of DHCP leases (ISC DHCP and Kea backends) that adds:
 - sorting by lease age (time since the lease started)
 - sorting and filtering by hardware manufacturer (MAC OUI lookup,
   with detection of private/randomized MAC addresses)
 - a right-click context menu to turn a lease into a static mapping
 - a manufacturer breakdown chart and live refresh

WWW: https://github.com/sandinak/pfsense-pkg-dhcp-lease-manager
